```Title: Screensaver Set to a Program Outside Windows or Program Files (CIM Endpoint.Registry)```
```ATT&CK: T1546.002 | Severity: medium | Sigma id: 22e1d805-6cc9-4cd3-86fb-b39cd8ef6754```
```Data source: CIM Endpoint.Registry data model. summariesonly=false works without acceleration; set true once the data model is accelerated.```
```False positives: Third-party screensavers installed in user folders```
```Suggested ES correlation search: cron */15 * * * *, earliest=-20m@m latest=-5m@m, throttle on the table fields, notable severity medium.```
| tstats summariesonly=false allow_old_summaries=true fillnull_value="null" count min(_time) as firstTime max(_time) as lastTime
    from datamodel=Endpoint.Registry
    where Registry.registry_path="*\\Control Panel\\Desktop\\SCRNSAVE.EXE" NOT (Registry.registry_value_data IN ("*\\System32\\*", "*\\SysWOW64\\*", "*\\Program Files\\*", "*\\Program Files (x86)\\*"))
    by Registry.dest Registry.user Registry.process_guid Registry.process_id Registry.registry_path Registry.registry_value_name Registry.registry_value_data Registry.action
| rename Registry.* as *
| convert timeformat="%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%S" ctime(firstTime) ctime(lastTime)
